      },
      "message": "feat(mcp): set_wcs_from_features places the WCS from role-tagged feature picks\n\nThe MCP twin of the GUI's \"Set WCS from features\" (#701): picks are\nlist_features ids each tagged origin, x, y or z. The tool runs the\nGUI's law (pick::align_roles) unchanged, converts the fit exactly as\nthe GUI's SetWcs does, and executes the existing undoable SetWcsOrigin\n- one History step, no frame maths of its own. Bad picks are refused\nby the law's own words; a setup that is not the active one is refused\nby name. camcraft-mcp skill documents the tool (PROCESS_VERSION 17).\n\nFixes #937\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
